\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Study overview.} \emph  {Top, primary paradox test (the central causal claim):} four surrogate backends (coarse hourly BB, matched-resolution BB, calibrated GB, and the role-separated hybrid) each train a thermostatic-PPO controller scored live on BOPTEST \texttt  {bestest\_air}; the higher-fidelity backends (GB, matched-resolution BB) collapse ($m_s>1$) while the coarse BB and the hybrid stay usable. \emph  {Bottom, boundary checks (dashed box, secondary):} HDRL, MORL, and a three-case hydronic transfer study map the scope of the recipe and are \emph  {not} part of the central test.}}{3}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
