\newlabel{fig:closed_loop_main}{{8}{19}{\textbf {Live closed-loop behaviour (typical window).} Zone temperature against the comfort band, with ambient disturbance and HVAC power, for the pure-BB, direct-GB, and hybrid controllers on the live BOPTEST runtime: direct GB saturates the actuator and leaves the comfort band, whereas the coarse BB and the hybrid track it and stay in band}{figure.caption.21}{}}
